      "writtenOn": "2025-03-17T06:14:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if the query used a subtype ?\n\nIf I query for `_subtype._sub._myservice._tcp.local`, only services that have the subtype should be marked as queried.\n\nSo I think you need to have the list of queried subtypes as argument (if it\u0027s empty, all services of the type match, but otherwise, they need to have one of the subtypes to match)",
