      "writtenOn": "2025-03-17T06:14:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could this be in EVENT_QUERY_RESULT instead ? The query will only be sent after some Handler loops, so the last query time isn\u0027t going to exactly match. The same problem exists in EVENT_QUERY_RESULT, but that one also sets lastSentTime, so at least the 2 would be consistent.\n\nI think that means you\u0027ll need to add servicesToResolve and sendDiscoveryQueries to the QuerySentArguments",
      "revId": "2424a6cc26898ec378501ef89f8524c40d59162d",
