      "side": 1,
      "message": "This method name doesn\u0027t sound like it should be updating state, \"makeResponsesForResolve\" just sounds like it should build some objects.\n\nIt\u0027s also inconsistent with how you updateLastQueryTimeForCachedServices (without the subtype). I think it would be clearer as:\n\n```\nif (sentDiscoveryQueries) {\n    serviceCache.updateLastQueryTimeForCachedService(subtypes, cacheKey, time);\n}\nfor (service : servicesToResolve) {\n    serviceCache.updateLastQueryTimeForCachedService(resolveName, cacheKey, time);\n}\n```",
